      "representative_excerpt": "Hello, As an advocate for preservation I ask that you do not increase the daily vehicle allowance. Access to the park is important, but to increase vehicle traffic would detract from the wilderness character. Instead please consider investing in more trails into the park and public use cabins/shelters. In summary please do not increase the vehicle use on...",
