      "representative_excerpt": "I strongly believe access in Denali should be limited to park buses and the annual road lottery. I worked in Denali 2003-4 and was born and raised in Anchorage. Park drivers are funny, brilliant and kind guides and the park should be left as free from human contact as possible. More private vehicles are not the answer to accessibility.",
