      "representative_excerpt": "It is not paved, is very narrow in places, and dangerous for inexperienced rural drivers. Despite posted speed limits that are meant to gaurd safety and minimize noise and dust, my experience has been that many people ignore these requirements which places lives (both human and animal) at risk. Finally, people come to Denali National Park to experience a...",
