      "representative_excerpt": "My concern is with the shift from an annual cap to a daily one. The current regulation limits access to 10,512 seasonal permits. At 160 vehicles per day over a roughly 110-day visitor season, the new limit could allow around 17,600 total vehicle entries per season, which is noticeably higher and could lead to larger effects on the park and its wildlife....",
